# (build 164) The teleport station's list in the retranslation: his
# places from names.json ("Arimaya", "Optano", "Skure": the JP's, where
# the stock has ARIMA, OPUTA, SKURE), the towns known set by hand ($C704
# on: Arima, Oputa, Skure) in a new game's Paseo station. His greeting
# ends with a press ({END}), and the question and the list follow it.
start building 15 30 0 0 7 18
language retranslation
flag $C704 5
flag $C705 6
flag $C706 3
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect menu $73
expect pixel 169 72 $EEE       # the top of Arimaya's A
shot 01_places
